  planner_response {
    response: "I have designed and built the **Chess eSports Championship** event landing page, translating the flyer into a modern dark-mode eSports experience:\n\n- **Visual & Atmospheric Design**:\n  - **Dark eSports Theme**: Crafted on a deep slate background (`#0b0f19` / `#0f172a`) illuminated by neon violet (`#8b5cf6`), electric gold (`#fbbf24`), and cyan accents.\n  - **Glassmorphism Architecture**: Translucent frosted panels with subtle glowing borders and depth layering across all sections.\n  - **Typography**: Paired the geometric display typeface *Rajdhani* for headings with *Outfit* for body typography and *JetBrains Mono* for stats and timers.\n\n- **Hero & Countdown**:\n  - Prominent title *\"CHESS eSPORTS: Compete. Think. Conquer.\"* framed with floating chess piece vectors and ambient lighting.\n  - Prominently displays the key stats *\"2 Days | 100 Players | 1 Champion\"* alongside a real-time event countdown timer and glowing *\"Register Now\"* call-to-action button.\n\n- **About & Core Pillars**:\n  - Highlights the 4 experiential pillars from the flyer: **Global Vibes**, **E-Sports Experience**, **Fun & Engagement**, and **One Goal (Outplay Your Opponent)**.\n\n- **Tournament Overview & Format Details**:\n  - **Interactive Progression Flowchart**: Visual progression tree mapping Day 1 (100 Players &rarr; Swiss System 5 Rounds &rarr; Top 32 Qualify &rarr; Round of 32) to Day 2 (Round of 16 &rarr; Quarter Finals &rarr; Semi Finals &rarr; Grand Final Crowning).\n  - **Format Rules & Tie-Breaks**: Tabbed breakdown covering Swiss system scoring (1 / 0.5 / 0 pts), Best of 3/5 Knockout rounds, Blitz playoffs (3+2), and the Armageddon decider.\n\n- **Interactive Schedule (Day 1 & Day 2)**:\n  - Fluid tab switcher with animated motion transitions between Day 1 and Day 2 schedules.\n  - Category filtering (Matches, Ceremonies, Breaks, Audience Specials) and search functionality.\n\n- **Awards & Recognition**:\n  - High-tier glassmorphic showcase featuring all 8 awards from the flyer: **Champion**, **Runner-Up**, **Best Tactical Player**, **Best Endgame Player**, **Fastest Checkmate**, **Best Move of the Tournament**, **Best Beginner**, and **Audience Favourite Player**.\n\n- **eSports Arena & Broadcast Experience**:\n  - Live broadcast mockup featuring digital board projection, evaluation bar, active match clock, and an automated caster commentary ticker.\n  - Interactive **Audience Tactical Challenge** puzzle where users can test their calculation speed and unlock celebratory confetti.\n\n- **Rules at a Glance & Registration Flow**:\n  - Expandable cards for the 5 core regulations: FIDE compliance, zero-tolerance anti-cheating, arbiter finality, and 10-minute punctuality rule.\n  - Interactive **Tournament Registration Modal** with validation, experience tiers, and instant generation of a personalized digital **Chess eSports Player Pass**."
