    response: "I have applied the **Immersive UI** design theme across the entire Chess eSports event landing page:\n\n- **Immersive Glass & Mesh Theme**: Transformed card surfaces into frosted glassmorphic containers with radial ambient backdrop glows (`#0f172a` base, `#8b5cf6` neon violet, and `#fbbf24` championship gold highlights).\n- **Hero & Core Pillars**: Styled the main tournament statistics (\"2 Days | 100 Players | 1 Champion\"), dynamic countdown clock, and 4 event core pillars with glowing accents and responsive hover states.\n- **Tournament Progression & Interactive Schedule**: Enhanced Swiss stage and knockout bracket cards, Day 1 & Day 2 interactive tabs, category filters, and live stage status indicators.\n- **eSports Arena & Live Caster Desk**: Formatted the virtual arena broadcast simulator, real-time caster ticker, evaluation bar, and audience move prediction poll with broadcast glass styling.\n- **Awards, Rules & Registration Modal**: Polished the grand champion crown display, hall of glory recognition cards, expandable fair-play rules, and digital player pass generator."
