    response: "I have updated the registration form and added the organizer CSV/Excel export tool:\n\n### 1. Registration Form Refinements\n- **Removed Rating Fields**: Completely removed **Rating Platform** and **Rating Score** from the form, types, and digital player pass.\n- **Added Date of Birth (DOB)**: Added a date picker (`YYYY-MM-DD`) with structured validation for player eligibility and check-in verification.\n- **Updated Digital Player Pass**: Now displays the competitor\'s full name, DOB, college/institution, and unique Pass ID.\n\n---\n\n### 2. Organizer & Admin Instant CSV / Excel Export\n- **Admin Export Button**: Added an **\"Admin Export\"** button in the top navigation bar and an **\"Organizer Access (Excel Export)\"** link in the footer.\n- **One-Click Excel / CSV Download (`.csv`)**: \n  - Formats all registered competitors with columns: `Pass ID`, `Full Name`, `Date of Birth (DOB)`, `Email Address`, `Contact Phone`, `College / Institute`, `Registration Date`, and `Seed Number`.\n  - Encoded with UTF-8 BOM so it opens immediately with perfect column alignment in **Microsoft Excel**, **Google Sheets**, and **Apple Numbers**.\n- **Live Search & Roster Management**: Organizers can filter and search players by name, DOB, email, college, or Pass ID directly inside the portal.\n- **Live Google Sheets / Webhook Sync (Optional)**: Includes a built-in webhook URL setting with a quick 1-minute setup guide so new registrations can also be streamed live into your online Google Sheet or Excel spreadsheet via Webhooks."
